{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin elements. Infinite momentum. Danger from every direction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Alone or together - Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/b1b10f46665714ec40535babc99dd3f1.avif?t=1758041861\" alt=\"Vexatious Combat\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.poster.avif?t=1758041861\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.webm?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/3ed7ff1af4d468a6eb213ff9668cbe86.mp4?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/f0e052a55e1063b52086e5678f17a54d.avif?t=1758041861\" alt=\"Combine The Elements\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.poster.avif?t=1758041861\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.webm?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/619e7adf3acd607189ff791bce4718c4.mp4?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/c93b111139b1442c702d0325d4b92db5.avif?t=1758041861\" alt=\"Fast-Fire Sessions\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a rapid-fire campaign of levels that explode with speed, chaos, and pure adrenaline.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.poster.avif?t=1758041861\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.webm?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/f16c23788dc8ed58da131cd3347f4208.mp4?t=1758041861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/89c56638c2af3c038457e6b11707722b.avif?t=1758041861\" alt=\"Co-Op &amp;amp; Solo\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with up to two allies. The challenge adapts, so every run is a test of survi